olution made by skilled Vietnamese artisans using traditional lacquerware techniques. With a sleek, polished surface and customizable finishes, it\u2019s ideal for luxury gifting, high-end product packaging, and cultural souvenirs.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"928\">Made from durable MDF or wood and coated in multiple layers of natural lacquer, these boxes provide elegance and protection for jewelry, cosmetics, tea, confectionery, and corporate gifts. The glossy or matte finish, along with optional inlays (such as mother-of-pearl or eggshell), makes each box a refined statement of craftsmanship.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"1069\">We offer <strong data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"959\">OEM\/ODM services<\/strong>, full customization in size, color, design, and logo printing for global buyers, retailers, and brand owners.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1074\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1098\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1098\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1495\">\n<li data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1165\">\n<p data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1165\">Handcrafted using traditional Vietnamese lacquerware technique<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1166\" data-end=\"1236\">\n<p data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1236\">Made from strong MDF or solid wood with high-gloss or matte finish<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1301\">\n<p data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1301\">Available with mother-of-pearl, eggshell, or metallic inlays<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1365\">\n<p data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1365\">Perfect for luxury product packaging and cultural gift sets<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1423\">\n<p data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1423\">Customizable interior (velvet, compartments, inserts)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1495\">\n<p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1495\">Export-ready with protective packaging and private labeling options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1497\" data-end=\"1500\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1529\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1527\">Why It Matters:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1686\">Each lacquer box not only delivers elegance but also embodies the values of sustainable, culturally rich craftsmanship. By choosing our handmade gift boxes:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"2036\">\n<li data-start=\"1688\" data-end=\"1783\">\n<p data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1783\">You <strong data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1720\">support local artisans<\/strong> who specialize in Vietnam\u2019s centuries-old lacquer techniques<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1871\">\n<p data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1871\">You help <strong data-start=\"1795\" data-end=\"1816\">create rural jobs<\/strong> and provide off-season income to farming communities<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1962\">\n<p data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1962\">You contribute to <strong data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1920\">Vietnam\u2019s export economy<\/strong> using 100% domestic materials and labor<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2036\">\n<p data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2036\">You help <strong data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2007\">preserve traditional artistry<\/strong> in a modern, global market<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2187\">At <strong data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2072\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd<\/strong>, we\u2019re a trusted <strong data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2139\">manufacturer, factory, and wholesale exporter<\/strong>, delivering quality lacquer products worldwide.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2192\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2228\">\u2709\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"2200\" data-end=\"2226\">Contact for Wholesale:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2391\">Looking for a reliable <strong da