}]}},{"id":713,"name":"Woven Rattan Box \u2013 Handcrafted Storage &#038; Gift Box from Vietnam","slug":"woven-rattan-box-handcrafted-storage-gift-box-from-vietnam","parent":0,"type":"simple","variation":"","permalink":"https:\/\/vietcraft.vn\/product\/woven-rattan-box-handcrafted-storage-gift-box-from-vietnam\/","sku":"VH24107","short_description":"<p>Natural woven rattan box \u2013 handcrafted for storage, gift packaging, and d\u00e9cor. Wholesale available direct from Vietnam factory.<\/p>","description":"<p data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"628\">This <strong data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"321\">woven rattan box<\/strong> is beautifully handwoven by skilled artisans in Vietnam using natural, sustainably harvested rattan. It offers a timeless blend of style, durability, and eco-conscious design \u2013 perfect for use as a <strong data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"535\">storage box<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"555\">gift packaging<\/strong>, or <strong data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"579\">decorative item<\/strong> in homes, retail shops, or hospitality settings.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"872\">Each box is tightly woven with smooth finishing and can be fitted with fabric lining, removable lids, handles, or customized labels to meet your branding or retail needs. Ideal for packaging beauty products, tea, spa items, jewelry, and more.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"1032\">As a direct <strong data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"915\">manufacturer and exporter<\/strong> based in Vietnam, we offer <strong data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"963\">OEM\/ODM services<\/strong>, wholesale pricing, and global delivery for importers and resellers.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1037\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1061\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1061\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1387\">\n<li data-start=\"1062\" data-end=\"1100\">\n<p data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1100\">100% handwoven from natural rattan<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1142\">\n<p data-start=\"1103\" data-end=\"1142\">Strong, breathable, and biodegradable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1201\">\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1201\">Available in various sizes, shapes, and color finishes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1270\">\n<p data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1270\">Customization for logo, fabric lining, compartments, and handles<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1328\">\n<p data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1328\">Perfect for storage, gifting, display, and decoration<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1387\">\n<p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1387\">Bulk orders, export-ready packaging, and custom branding<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1392\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1421\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1400\" data-end=\"1419\">Why It Matters:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1491\">By choosing this handmade rattan box, you&#8217;re supporting a craft that:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1783\">\n<li data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1555\">\n<p data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1555\"><strong data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1511\">Creates jobs<\/strong> for rural farmers during non-harvest time<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1632\">\n<p data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1632\"><strong data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1604\">Uses nearly 100% local materials and labor<\/strong>, keeping value in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1712\">\n<p data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1712\"><strong data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1667\">Helps generate export income<\/strong> and foreign exchange for the local economy<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1783\">\n<p data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1783\"><strong data-start=\"1715\" data-end=\"1756\">Preserves Vietnamese craft traditions<\/strong> in modern global markets<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1785\" data-end=\"1918\">At <strong data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1819\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd<\/strong>, we are a proud <strong data-start=\"1836\" data-end=\"1885\">factory, manufacturer, and wholesale supplier<\/strong> delivering quality with purpose.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1923\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1925\" data-end=\"1959\">\u2709\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1957\">Contact for Wholesale:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"2117\">Looking for a reliable <strong data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2022\">woven rattan box factory in Vietnam<\/strong>?<br data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2026\" \/>\ud83d\udce7 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2059\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2062\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2117\">www.vietcraft.vn<\/a><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":717,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24107-Wove-rattan-box.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24107-Wove-rattan-box.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24107-Wove-rattan-box.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH24107-Wove-rattan-box.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.