 protected while adding natural charm to your table. Handwoven by skilled artisans in Vietnam, the cover is made from natural bamboo and\/or rattan, designed with a dome or conical shape, and often includes a collapsible frame for easy storage.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"1018\">Ideal for use in homes, restaurants, resorts, and picnics, this food tent prevents insects from touching food while allowing airflow \u2014 a must-have for outdoor or tropical dining. Lightweight, durable, and biodegradable, it&#8217;s a sustainable alternative to plastic food covers.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1136\">We support <strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1053\">OEM\/ODM production<\/strong> and can tailor the size, shape, and packaging for your brand or hospitality needs.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1141\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1165\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1165\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1546\">\n<li data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1219\">\n<p data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1219\">Handwoven from 100% natural <strong data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1217\">bamboo or rattan<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1280\">\n<p data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1280\">Protects food from flies and dust while allowing airflow<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1329\">\n<p data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1329\"><strong data-start=\"1283\" data-end=\"1308\">Reusable, collapsible<\/strong>, and easy to store<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1383\">\n<p data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1383\">Eco-friendly, <strong data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1363\">biodegradable<\/strong>, and plastic-free<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1423\">\n<p data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1423\">Available in dome or conical styles<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1488\">\n<p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1488\">Suitable for homes, picnics, caf\u00e9s, restaurants, and resorts<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1546\">\n<p data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1546\">OEM\/ODM options for size, material blend, and packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1551\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1587\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1585\">Contact for Wholesale:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1588\" data-end=\"1721\">Interested in adding this to your eco-friendly collection?<br data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1649\" \/>\ud83d\udce7 Email: <strong data-start=\"1659\" data-end=\"1686\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1661\" data-end=\"1684\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><\/strong><br data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1689\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 Website: <strong data-start=\"1701\" data-end=\"1721\"><a class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1719\">www.vietcraft.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":640,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH25024-bamboo-food-tent.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH25024-bamboo-food-tent.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH25024-bamboo-food-tent.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/VH25024-bamboo-food-tent.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads