ce of functional art.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"852\">Perfect for <strong data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"651\">serving dry food, holding jewelry, or as a decorative accent<\/strong>, this dish fits beautifully in both contemporary and traditional settings. Lightweight, durable, and environmentally friendly, it\u2019s ideal for eco-conscious brands, boutiques, and hospitality projects.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"1023\">Each product is crafted by skilled Vietnamese artisans using traditional bamboo weaving and MOP inlay techniques \u2014 reflecting both cultural heritage and premium quality.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1108\">OEM and ODM options available for custom shapes, finishes, packaging, and branding.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1113\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1137\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1137\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1466\">\n<li data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1184\">\n<p data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1184\">Made from natural, sustainable <strong data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1182\">bamboo<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1236\">\n<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1236\">Hand-inlaid with real <strong data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1234\">Mother of Pearl (MOP)<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1290\">\n<p data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1290\">Elegant, shimmering finish \u2014 each piece is unique<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1340\">\n<p data-start=\"1293\" data-end=\"1340\">Ideal for <strong data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1338\">serving, decorating, or gifting<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1384\">\n<p data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1384\">Lightweight, durable, and biodegradable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1428\">\n<p data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1428\">Handmade by skilled artisans in Vietnam<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li 