art=\"879\" data-end=\"1009\">Available in various sizes and colors. We support <strong data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"953\">OEM &amp; ODM production<\/strong> for wholesalers, retailers, and global homeware brands.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1011\" data-end=\"1014\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1038\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1038\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1390\">\n<li data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1084\">\n<p data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1084\">Handcrafted from <strong data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1082\">natural cotton rope<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1132\">\n<p data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1132\">Soft-touch yet structured rectangular frame<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1218\">\n<p data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1218\">Perfect for <strong data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1216\">organizing or decorating shelves, bathrooms, nurseries, or stores<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1219\" data-end=\"1272\">\n<p data-start=\"1221\" data-end=\"1272\">Eco-friendly, <strong data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1252\">biodegradable<\/strong>, and plastic-free<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1333\">\n<p data-start=\"1275\" data-end=\"1333\">Made by Vietnamese artisans using <strong data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1331\">macrame techniques<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1390\">\n<p data-start=\"1336\" data-end=\"1390\">Custom sizes, colors, and branding available (OEM\/ODM)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1395\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1431\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1429\">Contact for Wholesale:<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1432\" data-end=\"1579\">We welcome inquiries from wholesalers, importers, and retailers.<br data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1499\" \/>\ud83d\udce7 Contact us at: <strong data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1544\"><a class=\