76\" data-end=\"1101\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1099\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1478\">\n<li data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1172\">\n<p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1172\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1130\">100% Natural Bamboo<\/strong> \u2013 Biodegradable, renewable, and stylish<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1248\">\n<p data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1248\">\u270b <strong data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1213\">Handwoven by Vietnamese Artisans<\/strong> \u2013 Supporting rural craftsmanship<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1332\">\n<p data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1332\">\ud83c\udf81 <strong data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1284\">Perfect for Gift Packaging<\/strong> \u2013 Cosmetics, crafts, wedding favors, and more<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1409\">\n<p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1409\">\ud83c\udfed <strong data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1369\">Factory Direct from Vietnam<\/strong> \u2013 Competitive pricing for bulk orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1478\">\n<p data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1478\">\ud83d\udd27 <strong data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1435\">OEM\/ODM Services<\/strong> \u2013 Custom logo, colors, closures, and sizes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2213\">\n<hr data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2218\" \/>\n<p data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2413\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2231\">MOQ:<\/strong> 300 pcs<br data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2242\" \/>\ud83d\udd52 <strong data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2259\">Lead Time:<\/strong> 25\u201335 days<br data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2273\" \/>\ud83d\udce9 <strong data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2286\">Email:<\/strong> <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2310\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><br data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2313\" \/>\ud83d\udcde <strong data-s