organizing daily essentials, or displaying decorative items, this tray brings both functionality and warmth to modern, rustic, or boho-style interiors.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"1099\">As a direct <strong data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"925\">manufacturer and factory in Vietnam<\/strong>, we offer competitive pricing, consistent quality, and bulk production for global buyers and importers. Custom sizes, colors, and branding are available under OEM\/ODM terms.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1243\">Whether you&#8217;re a homeware brand, gift retailer, or hospitality business, this eco-friendly tray is an excellent addition to your product line.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1248\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1275\">\u2705 <strong data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1273\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1672\">\n<li data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1358\">\n<p data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1358\">\u270b <strong data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1316\">Handwoven by Vietnamese Artisans<\/strong> \u2013 Using time-honored weaving techniques<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1442\">\n<p data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1442\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1389\">Eco-Friendly Material<\/strong> \u2013 100% natural rattan, biodegradable &amp; lightweight<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1443\" data-end=\"1510\">\n<p data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1510\">\ud83e\uddfa <strong data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1472\">Multi-Functional Use<\/strong> \u2013 For serving, organizing, or d\u00e9cor<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1590\">\n<p data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1590\">\ud83c\udfed <strong data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1534\">Factory Direct<\/strong> \u2013 Produced in Vietnam, with reliable wholesale supply<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1672\">\n<p data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1672\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1622\">Custom Orders Accepted<\/strong> \u2013 OEM\/ODM, logo stamping, and packaging available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2453\" data-end=\"2456\" \/>\n<p data-start=\"2458\" data-end=\"2561\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2469\">MOQ:<\/strong> 200 pcs<br data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2480\" \/>\ud83d\udd52 <strong data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2497\">Lead Time:<\/strong> 30\u201340 days<br data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2511\" \/>\ud83c\udf10 Export worldwide \u2013 EU, USA, Japan, Australia&#8230;<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2563\" data-end=\"2655\">\ud83d\udce9 <strong data-start=\"2566\" data-end=\"2581\">Contact us:<\/strong><br data-start=\"2581\" data-end=\"2584\" \/>Email: <strong data-start=\"2591\" data-end=\"2618\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2593\" data-end=\"2616\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><\/strong><br data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2621\" \/>WhatsApp\/Zalo: <strong data-start=\"2636\" data-end=\"2655\">+84-975-810-168<\/strong><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":470,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/VH25017-round-rattan-tray.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/VH25017-round-rattan-tray.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/VH25017-round-rattan-tray.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/VH25017-round-rattan-tray.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/up