8\" data-end=\"271\">bamboo serving tray<\/strong> is elevated with exquisite <strong data-start=\"299\" data-end=\"330\">mother of pearl (MOP) inlay<\/strong>, bringing a luxurious yet natural charm to any space. Carefully handcrafted in Vietnam, it combines eco-friendly bamboo with the shimmering beauty of real seashell, creating a piece that\u2019s both functional and decorative.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"818\">Perfect for serving tea, coffee, snacks, or as a stylish display piece for candles and decor. Lightweight yet durable, this tray reflects traditional craftsmanship with a modern touch \u2014 ideal for homes, hotels, and gift shops that value sustainability and elegance.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"823\" \/>\n<p data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"977\">\n<p data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1145\">\n<p data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1324\">\n<h3 data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1354\"><strong data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1352\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1753\">\n<li data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1426\">\n<p data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1426\">\ud83c\udf3f <strong data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1387\">Sustainable Bamboo Base<\/strong> \u2013 Lightweight, strong, and renewable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1497\">\n<p data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1497\">\u2728 <strong data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1461\">Real Mother of Pearl Inlay<\/strong> \u2013 Adds natural shine and elegance<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1586\">\n<p data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1586\">\u270b <strong data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1537\">Handcrafted by Skilled Artisans<\/strong> \u2013 Made in Vietnam using traditional techniques<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1671\">\n<p data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1671\">\ud83c\udf75 <strong data-start=\"1592\" data-end=\"1616\">Multi-functional Use<\/strong> \u2013 Serve drinks, snacks, or use as a decorative piece<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<l