rt=\"287\" data-end=\"627\">Bring luxury and natural beauty to your interior space with our handcrafted <strong data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"396\">Mother of Pearl (MOP) Planter<\/strong>, made in Vietnam. Each piece is carefully constructed by skilled artisans using a sturdy base and delicately inlaid with shimmering mother of pearl shells, creating a refined, iridescent surface that catches the light beautifully.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"897\">Perfect for indoor plants, floral arrangements, or as a standalone decorative piece, this planter adds elegance to living rooms, lobbies, spas, or boutique spaces. The craftsmanship not only reflects artistic tradition but also elevates the look of any plant it holds.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"1012\">Whether used in modern, coastal, or luxury interiors, our MOP planter is a timeless statement of artisan quality.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1305\"><\/h3>\n<h3 data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1501\"><strong data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1499\">Key Features:<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1873\">\n<li data-start=\"1502\" data-end=\"1573\">\n<p data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1573\">\u270b <strong data-start=\"1506\" data-end=\"1532\">Handcrafted in Vietnam<\/strong> \u2013 Shell inlay done by skilled artisans<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1645\">\n<p data-start=\"1576\" data-end=\"1645\">\u2728 <strong data-start=\"1578\" data-end=\"1602\">Real Mother of Pearl<\/strong> \u2013 Iridescent finish for a luxurious look<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1723\">\n<p data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1723\">\ud83e\udeb4 <strong data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1678\">Functional &amp; Decorative<\/strong> \u2013 Use for plants or as a standalone accent<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1795\">\n<p data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1795\">\ud83c\udfe1 <strong data-start=\"1729\" data-end=\"1748\">Timeless Design<\/strong> \u2013 Fits into luxury, spa, or modern interiors<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1873\">\n<p data-start=\"1798\" data-end=\"1873\">\u267b\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1827\">Eco-conscious Material<\/strong> \u2013 Natural shell elements and handcrafted base<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1878\" \/>\n<p><strong style=\"color: #555555;font-size: 14.4px\" data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2106\">Interested in wholesale, OEM\/ODM, or custom sizes?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2045\">\n<p data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2174\">\ud83d\udce7 <strong data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2139\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2114\" data-end=\"2137\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com<\/a><\/strong><br data-start=\"2139\" data-end=\"2142\" \/>\ud83d\udcde WhatsApp: <strong data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2174\">+84-975-810-168<\/strong><\/p>","on_sale":false,"prices":{"price":"0","regular_price":"0","sale_price":"0","price_range":null,"currency_code":"VND","currency_symbol":"\u20ab","currency_minor_unit":0,"currency_decimal_separator":",","currency_thousand_separator":".","currency_prefix":"","currency_suffix":" \u20ab"},"price_html":"","average_rating":"0","review_count":0,"images":[{"id":387,"src":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/08\/VH25011-MOP-Planter.jpg?fit=510%2C600&ssl=1","thumbnail":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/08\/VH25011-MOP-Planter.jpg?resize=300%2C300&ssl=1","srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/08\/VH25011-MOP-Planter.jpg?w=510&ssl=1 510w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/08\/VH25011-MOP-Planter.jpg?resize=340%2C400&ssl=1 340w","sizes":"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px","thumbnail_srcset":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/08\/VH25011-MOP-Planter.jpg?resize=280%2C280&ssl=1 280w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/vietcraft.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/08